// invBtn, invMsg and invErr for the invitation). Indonesian, Malay, German, Russian, Chinese and Japanese, which the
// booking app does not speak, follow src/i18n/TRANSLATING.md, with the challenge's names as the rating's last screen
// already says them (RatingFin.words.ts). `palestine`: the country picker's own word for it (lib/nationality.ts natOptions).
// Change a text here in every language at once.
